{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/insidechicagowalkingtours/items/176320/", "pk": 176320, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/insidechicagowalkingtours/", "pk": 40287, "shortname": "insidechicagowalkingtours", "name": "Inside Chicago Walking Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Open Your Eyes: Chicago's Underground Pedway & Other Secrets of the Loop", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 2, "unicode": "Open Your Eyes: Chicago's Underground Pedway & Other Secrets of the Loop", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": -0.25, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "#Come see the mysterious underground world of the Chicago Pedway!\n\nCome experience Chicago's famous \"Pedway\" – the mysterious underground tunnels downtown that keep us all warm & dry in bad weather. Walking in the Pedway, through hidden corridors of stained glass and even past underground swimming pools, we'll access interiors that seem to come up out of nowhere as you're exploring the tunnels. We’ll explore the hidden passages, overlooked details, rich symbolism, and quirky stories that add wonderful bits of color and texture to the overall narrative of the city.  The details people walk by every day will amaze you, and you’ll feel like you’ve truly seen a hidden side of Chicago by the end of this walking tour. This is not a typical \"must-see\" tour for typical tourists – it's a \"must see\" experience for travelers who want something BEYOND what's typical. Is that you? \n\nIn addition to our underground wanderings to stunning architecture interiors, we will cover some “secrets” above ground, in plain sight.  Are the waving balconies of Aqua really inspired by water, as so many guides say?  Did Picasso intend for his famous Daley Plaza sculpture to look like something — or someone — specific?  Ending with a fabulous interior not far from Millennium Park, you’ll be in the perfect central spot for continuing your exploration of downtown Chicago on your own after the tour!\n\nNOTE:  Weekday and weekend offerings of this tour route vary only slightly according to buildings’ hours of operation.  But every tour explores main stretches of the Pedway, and treats guests to fabulous interiors and hidden secrets!\n\n## Duration\n2 Hours\n*1.5 miles on foot*\n\n\n\n## Highlights of the Tour\n\n-- Navigate the best parts of the famous underground Pedway;\n-- See a world of stained glass both above ground and below;\n-- Look up through glass ceiling to the world outside, while remaining warm below ground;\n-- Discover hidden art that celebrates the city's rich architectural history;\n-- Much, much more!\n\n\n## Tour Details\n###Tours run rain or shine.\n- **Meeting Location:**  In front of 120 N. LaSalle St.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Chicago Loop", "booking_notes": "###What to Bring:\n\n - Comfortable clothing and shoes\n - Umbrella if needed\n - Bottle of water if needed\n - Extra cash for gratuities for your guide (optional, but appreciated!)\n_______\n\n###Please arrive at least 5 minutes prior to the scheduled tour time.  Your guide will be carrying a binder.\n\n###Tours generally run rain or shine.